  "entity": "HCMv3.PersonnelAdministration.EmployeeDocumentMvmt",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A withdrawal and return of one of the employee's documents — for example a passport handed back for travel.</p><p>While a movement has no actual return date, the document shows as out. Employees can request a passport withdrawal through self-service.</p>",
